<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Amalgamated buys Matilda Cruises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Amalgamated buys Matilda Cruises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cinema, hotel and resort operator Amalgamated Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it had executed a contract to acquire the business and assets of Matilda Cruises Pty Ltd for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Matilda Cruises owns ferry routes and conducts scheduled cruises and charter boat operations on Sydney Harbour.</p>
<p>Amalgamated expects the conditions of the contract to be satisfied early November 1996. It said it views the acquisition as a strategic move in an expansion of its operations in Australian domestic and inbound tourism.  </p>
<p>Earlier this year, Amalgamated lost out in a bidding war to AAPC Ltd for control of Sydney Harbour cruise operator Blue Line Cruises.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
